From: PW3 Android port
Subject: [PW3] Launcher3: the search bar searches the web in the browser

With no search application installed the home screen shows Launcher3's own
search bar, and a tap on it asks for the global search activity. Nothing
provides one on PW3, so the tap did nothing ("why does the search on the home
screen not react?", user, 2026-10-14). The user chose: the search bar searches
the web with the browser.

The bar is a text field now: a tap brings up the keyboard on the home screen,
the search key hands the words to the application that handles web searches
(ACTION_WEB_SEARCH; on PW3 the browser), which searches with its own engine.
The field is emptied when the search has been handed on.

